         SVG grammar means it).

         Both halves of TMDB's attribution rule live in Settings > About, side
         by side: the FAQ says "You shall use the TMDB logo to identify your use
         of the TMDB APIs" AND that the notice sentence must be placed
         prominently in an "About" or "Credits" type section. It also forbids
         changing the mark's color, aspect ratio or geometry - which is why this
         file is the official gradient rather than a tinted copy, and why it is
         not ic_rating_tmdb.xml (that one is a one-line letterform drawn from
         the app's own font, because the real wordmark is illegible on a 20dp
